### Linting & Coding Standards

- PHP: `composer run lint`
- JS: `npm run lint:js`
- CSS: `npm run lint:css`
- All: `npm run lint`
- Auto-fix: `npm run lint:fix`

### Testing
```bash

- JS: `npm test`
```bash
- PHP: `composer test` (if configured)

### Building

- Development: `npm run start`
```text
- Production: `npm run build`
- Create ZIP: `npm run plugin-zip`

